    <tags>cli ai agent code-intelligence codebase developer-tools tree-sitter llm</tags>
    <summary>Fast code intelligence engine for AI coding agents</summary>
    <description>
codebase-memory-cli is a native CLI-first code-intelligence application distributed
with authenticated release-owned runtime assets. Chocolatey retains the complete
extracted runtime set and exposes its executable through a PATH shim.

Full indexes an average repository in milliseconds, the Linux kernel (28M LOC) in
3 minutes. Answers structural queries in under 1ms. Supports 162 languages via
vendored tree-sitter grammars. No hosted service or API key. Designed for shell and agent-runner workflows with deterministic machine-readable
output and local repository intelligence.

After installation, run:

    codebase-memory-cli --help

to inspect the available CLI commands.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp/releases/tag/v0.10.8</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
